    {"id":"s1note","type":"text","x":1050,"y":140,"width":400,"height":100,"text":"Data forwarded at each hop:\n\nwebhook → run: userId, userName, task,\n  channelId, conversationId, agentSlug, context\n  (handles USER_MENTIONED, APP_MENTIONED, DIRECT_MESSAGE)\n\nrun → claw: + systemPrompt, agentConfig, meta\n  (agentConfig, agentSlug, channelId forwarded)\n\nclaw: workspace created, tools filtered by agent,\n  pendingQuestions collected from ask-user-question\n\ncallback: result, attachments, pendingQuestions\n\nResult handler:\n  approval → DM mentioned user (not sender)\n    with context: \"X mentioned you in #channel\"\n  conversation → reply in thread\n  pendingQuestions → post buttons in thread\n  user clicks → /app/callback → new /run\n\nSessions: Redis-backed, 24h TTL","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","strokeColor":"#868e96","opacity":100,"angle":0,"groupIds":[],"roundness":null,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"seed":28},

